ckable skins to traverse the Far Far West in style.</p>","developers":["Evil Raptor"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124540/f8cda3e9c2cd5eeffb7dbc738f14faf3d2d77baa/header.jpg?t=1771932375","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) 2025 Evil Raptor. All rights reserved. Developed By Evil Raptor. Published by Sold Out Sales and Marketing Limited trading as 'Fireshine Games'. All other copyrights or trademarks are the property of their respective owners and are being used under license.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3124540/1042774829/7d180783a35bb842b4fa3a00c7e8e11e6a5f875f/1771519771/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771520856","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3124540/1042774829/7d180783a35bb842b4fa3a00c7e8e11e6a5f875f/1771519771/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771520856","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3124540/1042774829/7d180783a35bb842b4fa3a00c7e8e11e6a5f875f/1771519771/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771520856","id":257290273,"name":"Demo Live Now!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257290273/9eb6f75494cec4b42d929d2e73e3a9580a759e2e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771520856"}],"name":"Far Far West","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> \u202fWindows 10 (64-BIT Required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790K or AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti or AMD Radeon RX 470<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Recommended</li></ul>","r